      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2011 Elsevier Ireland Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We measured circulating S100A8/A9 (MRP8/14) complex levels before and after 3-month treatment with pioglitazone in type 2 diabetic patients. The results showed that pioglitazone reduced circulating S100A8/A9 complex levels, without changing body mass index, in type 2 diabetic patients with abdominal obesity."
      },
